{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"ADEVX-134 shipped as navapbc/agentic-development-platform#22 at 6edfae3. stage() now takes allowed_paths, stages only declared paths, and runs git read-tree HEAD to restore the rest, returning the excluded set on StagedChange. changed_paths() is computed before the reset, so an empty excluded list is trustworthy. Ten tests added, full suite 1542 passed. Plan review and code review both PASS, code review attested at 6edfae3."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933496967099001,"uuid":"e5dda38a-1fdc-4f1a-8324-454d499d6965"}